Project 01 – Interactive Calculator & Unit Converter

Project: Python Programming

Description:

I developed an interactive, menu-driven calculator and unit converter using Python.

The project includes:

- Addition, subtraction, multiplication and division.
- Kilometers to miles conversion.
- Celsius to Fahrenheit conversion.
- Kilograms to pounds conversion.
- Input validation using while loops and try-except.
- Functions for individual operations.
- A menu that continues until the user chooses to quit.
- Division-by-zero handling.

Technologies Used: Python 3

Platform: Android Python IDE
